      "text": "The land that is Conkling Park was part of the ancestral homeland of the Coeur d'Alene Tribe, whose name means 'The Discovered People'.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
