      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Conkling Park’s temperate climate brings winter lows around 25°F and about 44 inches of snow, while summer highs reach 86°F.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/conkling_park_idaho",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Conkling Park sits on the western shore of Lake Coeur d'Alene, surrounded by forested hills and easy water access.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/conkling_park_idaho",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Wildlife around Conkling Park includes elk, whitetail deer, black bears, and a variety of birds.",
